    {
      "subId": "7500516",
      "subQuestName": "Open the gate",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500507",
      "subQuestName": "Search the ruins",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750050701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750050701": {
            "id": "750050701",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "The will of the Wayob made manifest... and you defeated it... You are mightier than I imagined.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050702"
            ]
          },
          "750050702": {
            "id": "750050702",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "Most tribesfolk would have retreated in reverence as soon as they laid eyes on it... For no one knows the reason why such manifestations appear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050703"
            ]
          },
          "750050703": {
            "id": "750050703",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "If you are fortunate, they may respond to you, but mostly, they come to \"solve\" one problem or another.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050704"
            ]
          },
          "750050704": {
            "id": "750050704",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So even you don't understand the Wayob's intentions?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050705"
            ]
          },
          "750050705": {
            "id": "750050705",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Ehrrr?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050706"
            ]
          },
          "750050706": {
            "id": "750050706",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "As I said before, the Wayob amass the will of departed guardians... They are great yet chaotic and abstruse by comparison, just like their realm, the Night Kingdom.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050707"
            ]
          },
          "750050707": {
            "id": "750050707",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "Legend has it that in the days after the dragon with blazing wings awoke from within its volcano, wretched humanity could but barely eke out survival from between its great fangs, claws, and the great banner-like span of its wings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050708"
            ]
          },
          "750050708": {
            "id": "750050708",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "And in the meantime, the Abyss's influence only grew and grew...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050709"
            ]
          },
          "750050709": {
            "id": "750050709",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "In that most perilous of times, they say, some tribespeople saw, in a trance, the obsidian branches that remained even in the deepest night.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050710"
            ]
          },
          "750050710": {
            "id": "750050710",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "And ever since then, more and more people of skill and talent would sense the Night Kingdom out there, beyond mundane sight... and they resisted the Abyss with totems, with the Ley Lines, and with the power of the elements.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050711"
            ]
          },
          "750050711": {
            "id": "750050711",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "This was the ancient altar where our tribal ancestors would use obsidian to communicate with the Night Kingdom.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050712"
            ]
          },
          "750050712": {
            "id": "750050712",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "The Wayob also gradually took shape during that time, totems and consciousnesses created by the congregation of each tribe's living and dead...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050713"
            ]
          },
          "750050713": {
            "id": "750050713",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So that's how it is... So that was just a part of the Wayob, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050714"
            ]
          },
          "750050714": {
            "id": "750050714",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "Yes, but a mere embodiment of a single thread of their will. They say that the Wayob possess no true solid shape or form. It might be hard to explain, but, uh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050715"
            ]
          },
          "750050715": {
            "id": "750050715",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "That entity will surely reappear should you provoke the Wayob!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050716"
            ]
          },
          "750050716": {
            "id": "750050716",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh. Let's just focus on putting this statue back on the altar, then!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500508",
      "subQuestName": "Find a way to venture deeper into the ruins",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750050801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750050801": {
            "id": "750050801",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "Right. Now it is time to return this to its rightful owner."
          }
        }
      }
