      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500515",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Legba",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750050501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750050501": {
            "id": "750050501",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "You've returned! You gave me quite the fright there, vanishing once you got close to the altar! I thought you'd been abducted by the Wayob...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050502"
            ]
          },
          "750050502": {
            "id": "750050502",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrrooo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050503"
            ]
          },
          "750050503": {
            "id": "750050503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, we got quite the fright ourselves. That place was super freaky. There was even a huge stone tablet that spoke to us!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050504"
            ]
          },
          "750050504": {
            "id": "750050504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#...What's wrong, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}? Were you worried?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050505"
            ]
          },
          "750050505": {
            "id": "750050505",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrroo... Mrrroo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050506"
            ]
          },
          "750050506": {
            "id": "750050506",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "Now, see what I told you? Your friends have returned, no?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050507"
            ]
          },
          "750050507": {
            "id": "750050507",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "Still... a huge stone tablet, you say?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050508"
            ]
          },
          "750050508": {
            "id": "750050508",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "(You tell Legba what you saw...)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050509"
            ]
          },
          "750050509": {
            "id": "750050509",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "*sigh* To defeat a manifestation of the Wayob's will... And from what you said, it sounds like you even entered the Night Kingdom...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050510"
            ]
          },
          "750050510": {
            "id": "750050510",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "It seems you are no ordinary outlanders... To think that I lived to see one who might return from the Night Kingdom... My life has been worth it after all, haha!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050511"
            ]
          },
          "750050511": {
            "id": "750050511",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "Alright, now that our \"little issue\" has been resolved, let us return. I must find a way to return the seal back to how it was...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050512"
            ]
          },
          "750050512": {
            "id": "750050512",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Little issue\"!? Didn't we, y'know, do... uh, that, to a manifestation of the will of your tribe's Wayob?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050513"
            ]
          },
          "750050513": {
            "id": "750050513",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "Eh, it's no biggie. They gather energy from the Ley Lines over time. You needn't fret on their account.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050514"
            ]
          },
          "750050514": {
            "id": "750050514",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, is it really okay for a tribesperson like you to be that cavalier about your own object of worship?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050515"
            ]
          },
          "750050515": {
            "id": "750050515",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "It is fortunate, yes — for you. Were I a stricter adherent, punishment would surely await you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050516"
            ]
          },
          "750050516": {
            "id": "750050516",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, yeah, no thanks!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050517"
            ]
          },
          "750050517": {
            "id": "750050517",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "And you, little one. Never dig anything up from around here again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050518"
            ]
          },
          "750050518": {
            "id": "750050518",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}",
            "text": "Rrah...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050519"
            ]
          },
          "750050519": {
            "id": "750050519",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "Hehe. Either way, let us make haste, before any ancestors decide to protest our actions!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7500503",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "750050301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "750050301": {
            "id": "750050301",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "Well... according to what's been passed down from our tribe, to enter the altar, we need to... <color=#00E1FFFF>\"line up the lights in this place\"</color>...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "750050302"
            ]
          },
          "750050302": {
            "id": "750050302",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Legba",
            "text": "I cannot be too sure, but perhaps we must align the height of the lamps controlled by the mechanisms."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}